---
description: Billing and pricing code standards
globs: ["billing/**", "pricing/**"]
alwaysApply: false
---
- Money is integer minor units (paise/cents) or Decimal. Never use float.
- Every usage event and ledger write needs an idempotency key (event_id).
- Never update or delete ledger rows; write adjustments instead.
- Prices come from the versioned price book. Never hard-code prices.
- Tests must cover duplicate events and late-arriving events.
- Use only dependencies already listed in requirements.txt.
